        {
          "text": " Kotomakon kemenenenata papa ka toto; kidinikon kiswamanakiniata ipejonon nukamwanir: kotomakon kenyamanakiniata kepali yenemamei papake ka apuserut, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
